   "text": "And the tile-serving path IS NOT A SERVICE AT ALL: no application logic on the read path, no database, and no request the\norigin normally sees. Making it a service would put compute in front of data that never changes - the definition of pointless\nwork. Updating the map publishes a NEW VERSION PREFIX rather than invalidating anything, because purging 5.86 trillion objects\nis not an operation anyone wants to attempt.",
   "originalText": "And the tile-serving path IS NOT A SERVICE AT ALL: no application logic on the read path, no database, and no request the\norigin normally sees. Making it a service would put compute in front of data that never changes - the definition of pointless\nwork. Updating the map publishes a NEW VERSION PREFIX rather than invalidating anything, because purging 5.86 trillion objects\nis not an operation anyone wants to attempt.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
