  {
   "id": "dl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1418,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 21,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100059,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700413,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The one place the CDN economics get uncomfortable",
   "originalText": "The one place the CDN economics get uncomfortable",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "dn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1456,
   "width": 1019,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100060,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700420,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The ~99% hit rate holds because tile requests are extremely concentrated - cities, motorways, tourist sites. But the LONG TAIL\nIS ENORMOUS: 4.4 trillion zoom-21 tiles exist and the overwhelming majority are requested approximately never. A user panning\nacross empty countryside generates a run of edge misses, each a fetch from object storage.",
   "originalText": "The ~99% hit rate holds because tile requests are extremely concentrated - cities, motorways, tourist sites. But the LONG TAIL\nIS ENORMOUS: 4.4 trillion zoom-21 tiles exist and the overwhelming majority are requested approximately never. A user panning\nacross empty countryside generates a run of edge misses, each a fetch from object storage.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "dn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1530,
   "width": 1003,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100061,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700427,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Two mitigations, both already in the design for other reasons: PREFETCH tiles adjacent to the viewport (the user is probably\nabout to pan there), and lean on UNIFORM-TILE DEDUPLICATION so an ocean tile is one cached object serving billions of\ncoordinates rather than billions of distinct cold objects.",
   "originalText": "Two mitigations, both already in the design for other reasons: PREFETCH tiles adjacent to the viewport (the user is probably\nabout to pan there), and lean on UNIFORM-TILE DEDUPLICATION so an ocean tile is one cached object serving billions of\ncoordinates rather than billions of distinct cold objects.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
