   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "nothing. APPEND-ONLY, TIMESTAMP-KEYED STORAGE MAKES\nREORDERING A NON-ISSUE, which is why no sequencing is\nneeded on a 694k samples/sec path.",
   "originalText": "nothing. APPEND-ONLY, TIMESTAMP-KEYED STORAGE MAKES\nREORDERING A NON-ISSUE, which is why no sequencing is\nneeded on a 694k samples/sec path.",
